      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "opacity": 100,
      "originalText": "Availability: only the founder's calendar is checked, never the attendee's\nAttendee gets cal.com's email invite either way; Book card says \"Only your calendar was checked\"\nTime taken? The closest open time comes back as a ready Book card + 2-3 time chips\nContacts: ranked by how often the founder books them, read from cal.com history (nothing stored)\nSecrets from env: LIVEX_OPENROUTER_API_KEY, CAL_OAUTH_CLIENT_ID, CAL_OAUTH_CLIENT_SECRET",
      "roughness": 1,
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 132202016,
      "strokeColor": "#495057",
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "text": "Availability: only the founder's calendar is checked, never the attendee's\nAttendee gets cal.com's email invite either way; Book card says \"Only your calendar was checked\"\nTime taken? The closest open time comes back as a ready Book card + 2-3 time chips\nContacts: ranked by how often the founder books them, read from cal.com history (nothing stored)\nSecrets from env: LIVEX_OPENROUTER_API_KEY, CAL_OAUTH_CLIENT_ID, CAL_OAUTH_CLIENT_SECRET",
